2. TEST MODE + SELF-HEALING LOOP
═══════════════════════════════
After .updatetohidbot writes new files, BEFORE restarting:
a. Run python -m py_compile on every changed .py file. Any compile error → reply ❌ with the exact error and the file, auto-restore from the backup made in this same update, and do NOT restart with broken code.
